# Content Agent — Environment Variables
#
# ALL keys are OPTIONAL. The agent generates content with zero API keys.
# These unlock bonus features if you want them.

# Ayrshare — Auto-publish to LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, etc.
# Get your key at https://ayrshare.com
# Without this: you copy-paste to publish. With this: agent publishes for you.
# AYRSHARE_API_KEY=your-ayrshare-api-key

# GPTZero — AI detection scoring
# Get your key at https://gptzero.me
# Without this: agent still self-audits for AI patterns (127 rules). With this: you get an external AI detection score too.
# GPTZERO_API_KEY=your-gptzero-api-key
